r_user_profile only create new user in sagemaker. The corresponding sso user is not assigned to IAM Identity Center application. So that the user cannot log\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-01-18T16:55:35Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.212,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 34578,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#34578\",\n      \"title\": \"r/aws_s3control_access_grants_instance: AWS IAM Identity Center integration\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"The aws_s3control_access_grants_instance resource released in Terraform AWS Provider **v5.27.0** does not support AWS IAM Identity Center integration as that functionality was not available during the beta test. Add it. Relates * aws_s3control_access_grants_instance hcl resource \\\"aws_s3control_access_grants_instance\\\" \\\"example\\\" { identity_center_arn = \\\"arn:aws:sso:::instance/ssoins-890759e9c7bfdc1d\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-11-27T19:44:59Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.203,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"corpus_size\": 11174,\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"likely\": 0.4,\n    \"possible\": 0.28\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7bf991ae-4169-4a1f-9db7-486ade95a864","uuid":"702b2f78-ac42-4417-8c34-ddef28392b4b","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:17:26.236Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 8,\n    \"title\": \"Add 'aws_ssoadmin_region' resource\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-06-13T10:28:22+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Request Net New Functionality\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_ssoadmin_region\",\n        \"resource_exists\": false,\n        \"da